<title>HONG KONG: IMC Holdings 1996 net down 56 percent.</title>
<headline>IMC Holdings 1996 net down 56 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   32.0	vs 73.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    14.0	vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  14.3 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    119.39    vs 275.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		     507.23    vs 595.64</p>
<p>    Company name		 IMC Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2-6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 19</p>
<p>NOTE - IMC Holdings is a shipping and trading company.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional gain on disposal of motor vessel.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 22 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of eight cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
